  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 50,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "I think we have found the most important factor for success.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A5E80AEBF5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "I'm here because I have a very important message: I think we have found the most important factor for success.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5156A965DE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "And it was found close to here, Stanford.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6619D55527",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "Psychology professor took kids that were four years old and put them in a room all by themselves.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "76D1EDCA2F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 122,
        "text": "And he would tell the child, a four-year-old kid, \"Johnny, I am going to leave you here with a marshmallow for 15 minutes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "87358BD037",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "If, after I come back, this marshmallow is here, you will get another one.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4E2704EE82",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "So you will have two.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8F1DA00F52",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 77,
        "endOffset": 144,
        "text": "is equivalent to telling us, \"We'll bring you coffee in two hours.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C210CBC258",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 77,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "is equivalent to telling us",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9504B14190",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "11823E722D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "So what happened when the professor left the room?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "06A0CC2EDC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "As soon as the door closed... two out of three ate the marshmallow.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "18086AACFD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "Five seconds, 10 seconds, 40 seconds, 50 seconds, two minutes, four minutes, eight minutes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "25CCE45D95",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "Some lasted 14-and-a-half minutes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5599C0E507",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0E0D05555D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Couldn't do it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6ACE86D943",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "Could not wait.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6D96B8C776",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 0,
        "text": "What's interesting is that one out of three would look at the marshmallow and go like this ...",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8C33E23FC0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "Would look at it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2CE5761B93",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 12,
        "text": "Put it back.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "350B15CC03",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "They would walk around.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1E53BEA5E2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "play with their skirts and pants",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BE1F43E573",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 40,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "the most important principle for success",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3A79E3CCB1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 73,
        "endOffset": 80,
        "text": "success",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "94D0FDE30A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "Self-discipline: the most important factor for success.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "61149A733F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 56,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "15 years later, 14 or 15 years later",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "39B83733E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "What did they find?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "10978EFA33",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "They went to look for these kids who were now 18 and 19.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B719B45FF5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "100 percent of the children that had not eaten the marshmallow were successful.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BC5CBE7631",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 88,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "successful",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DE7CB8F474",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "They had good grades.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "035E940A14",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "They were doing wonderful.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8C6B4CC1EB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 16,
        "text": "They were happy.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "14FFA2982D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "They had their plans.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F16AD44CCA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 56,
        "text": "They had good relationships with the teachers, students.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "02397CE9E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "They were doing fine.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7D3F264786",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "A great percentage of the kids that ate the marshmallow, they were in trouble.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ECAFCCD80E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "They did not make it to university.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26691311C1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "They had bad grades.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "391BCDD887",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "Some of them dropped out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "552E1250B3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "A few were still there with bad grades.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FECED42C7E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "A few had good grades.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C7E57C2308",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 29,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "Would Hispanic kids react the same way as the American kids?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "42F9540E2C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "So I went to Colombia.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5D0ECC573",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "And I reproduced the experiment.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2589132FFF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "And it was very funny.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "84044D37B4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "I used four, five and six years old kids.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4C402BDEE1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "And let me show you what happened.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7803E7BD48",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "(Spanish) (Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D9F9295E77",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "Hispanic kids, two out of three ate the marshmallow; one out of three did not.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0FCC7CACB7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 72,
        "text": "This little girl was interesting; she ate the inside of the marshmallow.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C69F8BF9F5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "In other words, she wanted us to think that she had not eaten it, so she would get two.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DD9E4D9532",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "But she ate it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "85047910BB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "So we know she'll be successful.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9238F47142",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "But we have to watch her.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "626CCCAEDD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
